<div class="rvp"><h2>button <span class="cnt">Button · 1457:668 · 220</span></h2>
<div class="banner"><b>Two things to check.</b> <code>Style=White</code> binds raw
<code>white</code> and raw <code>black</code> &mdash; not <code>neutral/white</code> and
<code>neutral/black</code>, so its label is #000 where every other button is #0d0d0d. And
<code>Large</code> + <code>Icon Only</code> is <b>58&times;58</b>, not 56 &mdash; the one break in
an otherwise regular size table.</div>
